{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-consistency-rollback-throttling","title":"迁移一致性校验、限流降级与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/migration-consistency-rollback-throttling","wordCount":2218,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移一致性校验-限流降级与回滚\">迁移一致性校验、限流降级与回滚</h1><p>分片的再平衡不会「一键完成」——把 12 亿行订单从 8 个逻辑库搬进 16 个，再让流量正式切过去之前，真正决定成败的是三件常被低估的事：怎么证明新旧两侧的数据逐行一致、怎么在迁移过程中不让主库被拖垮、以及切过去之后发现问题怎么退回来。本文把这三点拆成可执行的机制：双写窗口的一致性语义、行级校验与分块比对、基于复制延迟的速率闸门、以及可判断、可回退的割接流程。它接续<a href=\"consistent-hashing-virtual-node-partition\">一致性哈希、虚拟节点与逻辑分片模型</a>里建立的映射模型——那篇解决「键该落到哪个分片」，本文解决「落过去之后怎么确信搬对了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次在线分片迁移由三条互相独立的控制线构成，它们解决不同的问题、有各自的失败模式，不能混为一谈：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一致性线（校验）</strong>：证明目标分片与源分片在给定时刻的每一行数据等价。它的度量是「不一致 chunk 数」，终点是全量为 0。</li>\n<li><strong>速率线（限流）</strong>：把迁移工具自身产生的 I/O 与网络负载约束在线上可承受范围内。它的度量是「复制延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>」，控制在安全水位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以下。</li>\n<li><strong>可逆线（回滚）</strong>：保证在任意时刻都能退回上一个已知良好状态。它的度量是「距离最近一次不可逆操作有多远」，目标是把不可逆操作压缩到唯一一次切写。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条线在时间轴上并行推进，且相互耦合：限流太松会让从库延迟击穿读服务的 SLO，限流太紧会让校验窗口无限拉长；校验发现的不一致又只能通过回滚或补偿修复。下文按「双写语义 → 行级校验 → 限流闸门 → 回滚顺序」逐层展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双写窗口的一致性语义\">双写窗口的一致性语义</h2><p>在线迁移的通用骨架是<strong>四阶段</strong>：全量快照（snapshot）→ 增量追平（catch-up）→ 双写（dual-write）→ 割接（cutover）。每个阶段都引入一类独特的不一致来源，必须分开处理，而不是笼统地说「保证一致」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主库写入如何进入目标</th>\n<th>典型不一致来源</th>\n<th>校验手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量快照</td>\n<td>mysqldump / mydumper 读一致性快照</td>\n<td>长事务导致快照与真实值有偏差</td>\n<td>快照位点（GTID/POSIX）与增量起点对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量追平</td>\n<td>binlog / CDC 流（Debezium、Canal、Vitess VStream）</td>\n<td>重放乱序、DDL 在流中丢失</td>\n<td>位置位点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> 追平延迟归零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双写</td>\n<td>应用同时写新旧两侧</td>\n<td>一侧写成功、另一侧失败</td>\n<td>冲突日志 + 后台补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>割接</td>\n<td>切读 / 切写顺序不同</td>\n<td>切换瞬间的读写交错</td>\n<td>反向双写兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双写最常见的破绽是<strong>部分失败</strong>：应用先写旧库成功、再写新库超时，此时两侧分叉。正确做法不是把双写放在同一个本地事务里（跨分片做不到原子），而是让写入具备幂等键（如业务主键 + 版本号），失败侧进入本地重试队列，由后台对账任务（reconciler）按幂等键回放。Vitess 的 <code>MoveTables</code> 全量与增量阶段就是靠 VReplication 流持续追赶，并用 <code>VDiff</code> 做一致性核对（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/user-guides/configuration-advanced/resharding/\">Vitess Resharding 文档</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行级校验-checksum-分块比对与抽样代价\">行级校验：checksum、分块比对与抽样代价</h2><p>「看起来都对」不能作为验收标准。校验的最小可信单位是<strong>按分片键范围切块 + 逐块比对</strong>，而不是一张大表的整体 checksum。</p>\n<p>MySQL 自带 <code>CHECKSUM TABLE</code>（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/checksum-table.html\">MySQL 8.4 手册</a>），但它对全表加读锁、且在行格式或排序不一致时会产生假阳性，因此大表场景更常用 Percona 的 <code>pt-table-checksum</code>：它把表按索引切成块，逐块计算 <code>CRC32</code> 并写入一张 <code>checksum</code> 结果表，可在从库上并行比对（<a href=\"https://docs.percona.com/percona-toolkit/pt-table-checksum.html\">Percona Toolkit 文档</a>）。其核心判定逻辑是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>chunk</mtext></mrow></munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>32</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{chunk}} = \\bigoplus_{r \\in \\text{chunk}} \\mathrm{CRC32}(\\mathrm{concat}(r))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨁</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CRC32</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">concat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当新旧两侧同一 chunk 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{chunk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相等时才认为该块一致。逐块比对的价值在于<strong>可定位</strong>：整表哈希不等只能告诉你「表错了」，chunk 哈希不等能直接圈出是哪段主键范围。</p>\n<p>校验的代价随数据量线性上升，无法每轮全量跑。工程上常配合<strong>抽样策略</strong>：如果一块中存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 处真实差异、抽样覆盖比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则至少命中一处差异的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>detect</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{detect}} = 1 - (1 - p)^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">detect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（仅一处脏行）时检出率仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>——这解释了为什么割接前的最终校验必须<strong>全量</strong>，而日常巡检可以用低比例抽样。TiDB 与 CockroachDB 在搬迁分布式 Region/Range 时，也采用类似「范围级校验 + 差异修复」的机制：TiDB 的 <code>Lightning</code> 与 <code>BR</code> 支持 <code>checksum</code> 表级校验（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/backup-and-restore-overview\">TiDB 文档</a>），CockroachDB 的 <code>RESTORE</code> 则通过 <code>cluster setting</code> 控制校验强度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流-以复制延迟为反馈信号\">限流：以复制延迟为反馈信号</h2><p>迁移工具本身是主库上的一类新型写负载。如果不加约束，大表的 chunk 拷贝会把 redo/undo 与网络带宽吃满，直接表现为<strong>从库复制延迟飙升</strong>——而读流量正压在这些从库上。因此几乎所有成熟工具都把「复制延迟」当作迁移速率的反馈信号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>gh-ost</strong>（GitHub 的无触发器在线表变更工具）提供 <code>--max-lag-millis</code>：当任一从库的 <code>Seconds_Behind_Master</code> 超过阈值时，它暂停拷贝 chunk，等延迟回落后再继续（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-ost\">gh-ost 项目文档</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>pt-online-schema-change</strong> 提供 <code>--max-lag</code> 与 <code>--check-interval</code>，语义一致：延迟超限即降速。</li>\n<li><strong>Vitess Throttler</strong> 把限流做成了一等公民，用多种指标聚合出一个 <code>throttler</code> 状态，<code>MoveTables</code>/<code>VReplication</code> 在状态为限流时自动降低追赶速率（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/reference/features/tablet-throttler/\">Vitess Tablet Throttler</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个实用的退避律是：拷贝速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 随延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 反比衰减</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(\\ell) = v_0 \\cdot \\frac{\\alpha}{\\max(\\ell, \\ell_0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0436em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是安全延迟、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是调节常数。延迟低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时全速，超过后速率按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 收敛，避免「一放量就爆延迟、一停就空转」的震荡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[开始 chunk 拷贝] --&gt; B{从库延迟 l &lt; l0?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[全速写入目标分片]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[暂停 / 降速&lt;br/&gt;v = v0 * a / l]&#10;  D --&gt; E[等待 check-interval]&#10;  E --&gt; B&#10;  C --&gt; F{全量块完成?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| B&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[进入增量追平]&#10;  G --&gt; H{追平延迟归零?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[切双写]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| G\">flowchart TD\n  A[开始 chunk 拷贝] --&gt; B{从库延迟 l &lt; l0?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[全速写入目标分片]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[暂停 / 降速&lt;br/&gt;v = v0 * a / l]\n  D --&gt; E[等待 check-interval]\n  E --&gt; B\n  C --&gt; F{全量块完成?}\n  F --&gt;|否| B\n  F --&gt;|是| G[进入增量追平]\n  G --&gt; H{追平延迟归零?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[切双写]\n  H --&gt;|否| G</pre><p>限流不只是「慢一点」。它同时是<strong>降级策略的触发器</strong>：当延迟持续超过硬阈值（如 30 秒）且无法回落时，应主动降级——暂停迁移、把读流量回切到原主库、保留已完成的 chunk 断点，而不是硬推进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚-把不可逆操作压缩到最小\">回滚：把不可逆操作压缩到最小</h2><p>在线迁移的可回滚性取决于<strong>切换点前后的顺序设计</strong>。一次割接真正不可逆的动作只有「旧库停止接受写入」这一个瞬间，其余步骤都应保留返回路径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>回退方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建影子表 / 全量快照</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n<td>直接 drop 影子表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量追平（CDC 流）</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n<td>停流、丢弃目标数据重来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开启双写</td>\n<td>可逆（有成本）</td>\n<td>关闭新库写入，保留旧库为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切读（读走新分片）</td>\n<td>可逆</td>\n<td>回切读路由，旧库仍是最新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切写（旧库停写）</td>\n<td><strong>单点不可逆</strong></td>\n<td>只能反向双写 + 反向 CDC 补偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此稳健的顺序是<strong>先切读、后切写</strong>：读切到新库后如果发现校验或性能问题，读回切是零成本的；只有当读在新库稳定运行（通常观察 1–3 天，覆盖一个完整业务周期）之后，才执行写切换。切写之后仍不立即关闭旧库，而是保持一段<strong>反向双写</strong>窗口——旧库继续接收写入并经反向 CDC 回流到新库，一旦新库出现问题，可快速把写切回旧库（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/user-guides/configuration-advanced/resharding/\">Vitess Cutover 流程</a>）。</p>\n<p>gh-ost 与 pt-osc 在单表变更层面的回滚采用同一思路：变更在影子表上进行，只有 <code>RENAME TABLE</code> 那一秒是原子的、不可逆的切换点，之前任何时刻都可以 <code>--panic</code> 放弃并保留原表（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-ost\">gh-ost 交互命令</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"割接判定清单\">割接判定清单</h2><p>割接不应依赖「感觉差不多了」。一个可执行的门控应同时满足：增量追平延迟持续为 0（例如连续 5 分钟）、全量校验 0 个不一致 chunk、双写冲突率低于阈值、以及目标分片的写延迟与错误率不劣于旧库。任何一项不达标都意味着应停留在当前阶段继续观察，而非推进——把「不切」作为默认动作，是迁移工程最重要的保守性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>迁移的可靠性来自三重防护叠加：<strong>校验</strong>回答「数据是否一致」（分块 CRC 比对 + 全量终验），<strong>限流</strong>回答「迁移会不会拖垮线上」（延迟反馈闸门），<strong>回滚</strong>回答「出错了能否退回」（先切读后切写 + 反向双写窗口）。三者缺一，再平衡都会从「可控的扩容操作」变成一次高危的在线手术。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移一致性校验、限流降级与回滚","id":"迁移一致性校验-限流降级与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双写窗口的一致性语义","id":"双写窗口的一致性语义"},{"level":2,"text":"行级校验：checksum、分块比对与抽样代价","id":"行级校验-checksum-分块比对与抽样代价"},{"level":2,"text":"限流：以复制延迟为反馈信号","id":"限流-以复制延迟为反馈信号"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚：把不可逆操作压缩到最小","id":"回滚-把不可逆操作压缩到最小"},{"level":2,"text":"割接判定清单","id":"割接判定清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"在线扩容：双写、数据回填与流量切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/online-resharding-dual-write-backfill-cutover"},"next":{"title":"跨片 JOIN、聚合与执行计划下推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/crossshard-join-aggregation-pushdown"}}